# Capacitor app shell — generated / machine-specific artifacts.
# The native android/ project is regenerated by `npm run setup` (npx cap add android),
# so it's ignored wholesale. If you later hand-customise native files you want to keep
# (signing config, AndroidManifest edits, custom activities), un-ignore those specific
# paths or commit android/ deliberately.

node_modules/
android/

# Build outputs / local config (harmless even if android/ is un-ignored later)
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
